     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Data scientists are responsible for obtaining informed consent from individuals or companies before collecting their data. This involves informing them of the purpose and scope of data collection, giving them the option to give or withhold consent, and ensuring the documentation and security of the consent."
